# first-creature-haste: "Whenever a creature you control enters, if it's the first creature to enter the battlefield under
# your control this game, it gains haste until end of turn." Bot2's Llanowar Elves enters first, on turn 2, and is no
# creature of Bot1's. Bot1's first, Grizzly Bears on turn 3, gains haste (CR 702.10) and attacks the turn it came; the haste
# ends with the turn (CR 514.2). Bot1's second creature, Llanowar Elves on turn 5, is not the first and gets nothing: it is
# summoning sick (CR 302.6).

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest x2
Grizzly Bears
Llanowar Elves
Forest x36

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Island x38

[Variant]
Bot1: emblem Gear test: first-creature-haste

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#2.Activate
? Stack = Grizzly Bears
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack = Gear test: first-creature-haste
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Keywords = Haste
Bot1.Attack(Grizzly Bears > Bot2)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Keywords = (absent)
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#1.Activate
? Stack = Llanowar Elves
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Keywords = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Keywords = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.SummoningSick = true
